Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.309 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  most people want to adopt  a cute little dog or a playful kitten  but some want more to love this is why  these animal lovers decided to make a  huge addition to their family  by adopting terrifyingly cute monsters  wait until you see what kris jenner  accidentally adopted you'll quickly  understand  why it is not part of the kardashians tv  show anymore  if you are new to our channel click that  red subscribe button  and give this video a big thumbs up  today you'll get the chance to meet  10 people who accidentally adopted  monsters  esther the wonder pig miniature pigs are  more and more popular as pets  just like a little pink dog with a curly  tail they like to run around  everywhere cuddle with their friends and  wear funny costumes  however don't think these babies will  stay tiny forever  they all grow up to be beautiful adult  pigs micro pigs can be the size of a  small adult labrador retriever  so imagine how big other pigs can be  esther the wonder pig is a great example  of that  the bigger the better you can never get  enough of cuteness with esther  this pink lady was misrepresented as a  micro pig  and sold to steve and derek the little  girl who weighed 4 pounds  grew up to be 500 pounds in less than  two years  they loved her so much they couldn't  leave her so they decided to adjust  their lifestyle to this new family  member  keeping her was the best choice they  ever made and many people agree with  that  esther now has a huge fan club and you  can find out more about her story in her  book  her owners want to share a message to  encourage people to change their  consumption habits  and lead a cruelty-free lifestyle forget  waking up to eat bacon  we want to start our day next to the  beautiful esther the lion queen  actress tippy hadron didn't want to be a  cat lady  so she became a lion queen instead and  she plays with neil  just like she would with any other  feline they sleep together  bathe in the sun or just lay around the  house this big cat is not even scared of  water as they like to play in the pool  together  who thought lions could be so sweet a  trainer taught the family how to act  around the wild animal they were advised  not to send him off  scratch its nose or turn their backs to  the lion but following these  instructions  neil quickly became the family's best  friend and everyone talked about him  however  years after hadrian deeply regrets  allowing lion to roam freely around in  her family home  neil could have turned out to be a  monster she confessed that it was stupid  to let this wild beast  live with the one she loved the lion  could have attacked them at any time  even though neil was nice no one was  able to control him  and a playful game could have easily  ended up in an accident  fortunately nothing bad happened to  tippy she found another way to be close  to wild animals by running a lion  sanctuary  if you ever want to adopt a wild animal  that's your choice but we don't suggest  you walk your lion on the leash  just in case he doesn't love strangers  like he loves you  the smelly monster if you ever thought  that your dog smelled bad  you are not ready for a skunk and you  are not ready to visit deborah chapani  either  she keeps 50 skunks in her home this  woman from ohio runs the only rescue  center for domestic skunks in america  she said she loves these smelly  creatures for the same reason people  love dogs  they are lovable devoted animals and  debra is really devoted to them too  she wakes up every morning at 4 30 am to  make sure they are all fed in time and  clean them  the same routine starts all over again  when she comes back from work she even  sets up her own event the skunk fest  it includes a beauty pageant for skunks  and an award for the best dress just  look at these two  being crowned king and queen deborah  thinks this festival  is a great occasion to help the public  see the skunks in a different light  they've had a bad reputation  because of their smell but she wants  everyone to see that they are much more  than that  deborah might not see skunks as smelly  little monsters but that's what is so  amazing  she sees the beauty behind something we  think is terrifying and we should learn  a lot from that too  the wild dog what can go wrong with an  adorable puppy  once you take home this new member of a  family your life is filled with fun and  unconditional love we couldn't resist  the urge to pet this good little boy  either  however after he was adopted the animal  named neo behaved strangely  he wanted constant non-stop attention  and was always escaping to play with  other dogs  no matter how high the fence was he  found a way out the neighbors were  concerned and this is when someone  noticed that neo had something special  he was not a dog but a wolf dog  it is a mix of the two species this  wasn't good news because wolves are not  meant to be confined  in a human's home and need to be with  other canines when the owners found out  about it  they agreed to place neo in a canine  sanctuary in california the wolf dog now  has the chance to live a happier life  howling at the moon with other wolf  friends this is what love truly is  doing everything so your best friend can  be happy even if that means that they  will have to leave you  the longest cat in the world kelsey gill  always wanted a big cat  after seeing this animal featured in the  harry potter movies she knew she wanted  that type of feline  however what she didn't expect was that  she would get the biggest cat of them  all kelsey adopted ludo at 13 weeks old  and quickly noticed that he was much  longer than the other cats and she was  right to think so  ludo earned a place in the guinness  world record 2017 edition  as the world's longest domestic cat  living he now measures an impressive  1 18th meter or 3 feet and 10 inches  that's  longer than the height of the average  three-year-old child unfortunately  due to his big size pluto is less agile  and much more clumsy than other felines  he is so big that kelsey has to put him  in a dog carrier when they travel  but one advantage is that ludo can't  hide so his owners are  always able to find him easily ludo is a  lazy  big cat he loves lazing around being  stroked and cuddling with his friends  who can blame him we would love to live  the life of a lazy cat sometimes  too the giant pitbull pit bulls are  already really impressive they are  strong  muscular and almost intimidating imagine  what it would be like to meet a pit bull  who's bigger than average like hulk  unfortunately some people only judge  these dogs by their appearance  they have a bad reputation accused of  being violent and aggressive  many cities and jurisdictions all over  the world banned pit bulls or restricted  the keeping of the dogs by breed  typically targeting them  this idea is nothing but a prejudice as  the owner is responsible for the  behavior of the dog this is what marlon  grenon  the owner of hulk wants to prove he  breeds the dog to be unnaturally huge  and sells the puppies to loving families  his goal is to show people  that we shouldn't be protected from pit  bull but that these enormous dogs can  protect  us brendan claims that his dogs can be  trained to any level of protection  including for high level security or  family and personal protection how can  you look at this face and be upset once  you train these dogs to use their  strength in a good way  they will always be there to help you  but dog lovers beware  hulk might attack you with a lot of  cuddles and kisses  the three tigers this family wasn't  satisfied with an ordinary pet  so they bought a tiger then they weren't  satisfied with the tiger so they bought  two more  everything's bigger in texas and it is  true for bill rathburn's cat too he and  his wife raised  three 600 pound tigers since they were  born but what is fun about this story is  the reason why they have these animals  bill explained that his wife just went  out and bought one without consulting  him not only this surprise was costly  but it was also  really dangerous fortunately these big  cats can become  lovable animals when you take good care  of them bill and his wife have nothing  to worry about  not even the law in texas there are no  regulations when it comes to exotic  animals  because they are considered private pets  it means nothing is stopping you from  buying any animal you want  that's probably one of the reasons why  there are now more than 2 000 tigers  living in texas  this means texas police department also  has to deal with tigers on the run  let's hope that we don't meet one on the  street do you think it's okay for  someone to surprise their family with a  new pet we want to know what you think  so leave us a comment  the ferret on steroids this man wasn't  looking for anything unusual  so he bought two adorable toy poodles  what could go wrong with this  look at this little face that makes you  feel like everything will always be okay  however the creatures this man received  seemed to be a little special  he should have noticed that something  was wrong when the dogs were sold for 75  each instead of a thousand dollars but  it was not until a visit to the vet that  his owner  found out he didn't adopt toy poodles  but ferrets  wait these animals don't look the same  at all how can anyone make this mistake  it turns out the ferrets were filled  with steroids and so fluffy you could  barely see what they looked like  even if the man was disappointed this is  not a reason to not turn these little  monsters  into his best friends ferrets can be  adorable pets too  these little creatures love to exercise  and explore the world  you can even train them and make them  wear sweaters just like you would do  with a toy poodle even if the owner was  probably really surprised he's not  missing anything with his new ferrets  the pet turtle turtles can be great pets  for animal lovers who don't have a lot  of energy  to spend and want a best friend for the  next 20 years they come in different  size  are strong swimmers and always act like  nothing is stressful but it seems like  some people wanted a dog instead  and decided to go on an adventure with  their turtle have you ever seen someone  walking their turtle on a leash  there's a first time for everything and  you'll want a pet turtle too once you  see this picture but how do you use a  leash with a turtle  most people just put a collar around  their turtle shell but this one is so  big  there is no way a collar can go around  it this is why someone invented  something to solve the world's most  unusual problem the turtle leash now you  can safely walk your turtle with suction  cups stuck to its shell this man must be  really patient because it probably takes  hours for it to make it to the corner of  the street no matter what  they both look happy together and that's  what counts look at the man smiling  and this turtle confidently coming out  of its shell these two  are meant to be together the new  kardashian sister  kim chloe and courtney rented a monkey  called susie for a week to play a prank  on their mother chris  she was asking them to settle down and  have kids so the sisters planned a  little revenge  chris had to take care of a monstrous  child too she treated susie  just like a human baby holding her in  her arms making her wear pink clothes  feeding her with a spoon and playing  with her around the house  it was so funny to see the monkey  randomly had a bad temper sometimes  unfortunately it wasn't the best time to  play this kind of joke  days before she posted the pictures a  chimp attacked his owner  and the police had to take care of the  situation this is why kim was called  irresponsible and  insensitive when she found out about it  the reality tv star felt really sorry  for what happened  she explained that the pictures were  taken six months before and that she was  praying for everyone involved in the  monkey attack  she didn't mean to insult or offend  anyone you are forgiving kim but next  time  try not to monkey around when it comes  to wild animals you'll see  there is beauty everywhere in the animal  kingdom if you give these amazing  creatures a chance  which unusual animal would you like to  adopt tell us in the comments down below  don't forget to like this video and  subscribe to the things  if you want to watch more videos like 10  common animals that look  out of this world thanks for watching

